  "description": "Dex has a dangerous gift: with a single touch, he can read the memories of others. For the past thirty years, he’s been bound by a lifetime contract with the Hero Association, forced into service to cover up a mysterious incident. Now, the Association makes him an offer - if he can uncover the criminal past of the notorious villain Jin, suspected of recent terrorist attacks, they’ll finally set him free. Determined to return to the people he loves, Dex accepts. But to dig into Jin’s memories, there’s only one way forward: intimate contact that blurs the line between mission and desire. Will Dex succeed in his task? Or is he going after something impossible…?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
